OL,3,GNEWSAAirbnb host catches dozens at
OL,4,Aparty on smart doorbell
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Airbnb host says he is considering
OL,7,Fending holiday lets after a booking for
OL,8,Ffour guests turned into a party
OL,9,Fallegedly attended by up to 80 people.
OL,11,FOwner Alex Negrescu said blood was
OL,12,Ffound on the walls and carpets were
OL,13,Fdamaged at his house in Gloucester. It
OL,14,Fhas left him questioning the future of
OL,15,Fthe business despite earning about
OL,16,F#20,000 in the past six months.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
