OL,3,GNEWSAAirbnb host catches dozens at
OL,4,Aparty on smart doorbell
OL,5,
OL,6,FNegrescu said his smart doorbell
OL,7,Falerted him to a large number of people
OL,8,Farriving at the property on Saturday,
OL,9,Fwith up to 80 people there by the time
OL,10,Fhe arrived, including an unconscious
OL,11,Fman.
OL,13,FAn Airbnb spokesperson said "disruptive
OL,14,Fparties are banned" on the platform and
OL,15,Fconfirmed the guest has been suspended
OL,16,Ffor three years.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
